  "story": {
    "text": "At the Westons’ Christmas party, Mr. Elton {SQUEEZES} onto the sofa beside Emma. Then it {SNOWS}, and everyone hurries home. Alone with Emma in the {CARRIAGE}, Mr. Elton, warm with {WINE}, {DECLARES} his love: for her, not Harriet! Emma is {SHOCKED}; he is {OFFENDED} that she could think him meant for Harriet Smith.",
